<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:13:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在三星、SK 海力士和韩国政府的支持下，Rebellions 首席执行官 Sunghyun Park 希望证明主权人工智能能够带来回报</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/rebellions-ceo-samsung-sk-hynix-soveriegn-ai-nvidia/</link><description>这家初创公司是针对 Nvidia 的挑战者浪潮的一部分，重点不是训练人工智能模型，而是以低廉的成本运行它们。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/INFA_Sunghyun-Park_Rebellions_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:01:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/rebellions-ceo-samsung-sk-hynix-soveriegn-ai-nvidia/</guid></item><item><title>为什么越来越多的美国人选择分期付款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/block-why-more-americans-are-choosing-to-pay-over-time/</link><description>如今，用信用卡支付午餐已成为惯例。情况并非总是如此。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2296960631-e1795208813729.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/block-why-more-americans-are-choosing-to-pay-over-time/</guid></item><item><title>“我们在乞求”：DOGE 将联邦劳动力削减至 60 年来的最低水平，特朗普政府表示仍无法招聘 Z 世代工人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/doge-federal-workforce-reductions-government-gen-z-hiring-efforts/</link><description>“我发现越来越多的年轻人不想申请，这很有趣，”运输部长肖恩·达菲本月早些时候告诉德克萨斯基督教大学的学生。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297262633-e1795548000673.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:40:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/doge-federal-workforce-reductions-government-gen-z-hiring-efforts/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 首席科学家认为“困惑”可能是协调人工智能放缓的关键</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/openai-chief-scientist-thinks-perplexity-might-be-the-key-to-coordinating-an-ai-slowdown/</link><description>该提案是黎曼猜想的证明，一份关于人工智能加速人工智能研究的报告让许多业内人士感到震惊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305719109-e1795553301242.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:08:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/openai-chief-scientist-thinks-perplexity-might-be-the-key-to-coordinating-an-ai-slowdown/</guid></item><item><title>黄仁勋重返 Nvidia 的 11 天</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/the-11-days-that-brought-jensen-huang-back-to-nvidia/</link><description>英伟达周一宣布，董事会恢复黄仁勋担任首席执行官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299110515-e1795464871850.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:07:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/the-11-days-that-brought-jensen-huang-back-to-nvidia/</guid></item><item><title>女子足球拥有 10 亿美元的机会——英格兰两大联赛的首席执行官想要分一杯羹</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/womens-super-league-football-1-billion-opportunity/</link><description>女足超级联赛首席执行官尼基·杜塞特是英国女足界最有权势的人。她面临着将人们对这项运动日益高涨的兴趣转化为利润的挑战。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WSLE_Nikki-Doucet_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/womens-super-league-football-1-billion-opportunity/</guid></item><item><title>“自愿、可撤销”：Anthropic 创始人 1120 亿美元捐赠承诺背后的细则</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-ipo-charity-pledges-stock-price/</link><description>一支股票基金、高达 3 比 1 的员工匹配以及 80% 的创始人承诺，意味着 Anthropic 的捐赠金额与其股价相当。这是每个人的立场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305300345.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:49:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-ipo-charity-pledges-stock-price/</guid></item><item><title>国防科技风险投资上季度达到创纪录的 379 亿美元。两位投资者表示，这看起来像是 2021 年</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/defense-tech-bubble-yolo-tourist-investors-2021/</link><description>上个季度，风险投资公司向国防科技领域投入了创纪录的 379 亿美元。华盛顿港的 Mina Faltas 和 Eclipse 的 Aidan Madigan-Curtis 警告说，旅游资金追逐的是信号，而不是能力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/backingamericahardproblems.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:17:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/defense-tech-bubble-yolo-tourist-investors-2021/</guid></item><item><title>“这似乎是一种极端的隐私侵犯行为。”报告称，来自 Muse AI 代理的令人惊讶的消息让 Meta 自己的员工感到不安</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/meta-employees-muse-ai-agent-extreme-privacy-violation-encrypted-signal-messages/</link><description>在一个例子中，一位 Meta 工作人员报告说，Muse 在她的个人手机上向她发送了一条提醒，要求她回复她姐姐在加密消息服务 Signal 上发来的消息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2296209094-e1795275033380.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:28:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/meta-employees-muse-ai-agent-extreme-privacy-violation-encrypted-signal-messages/</guid></item><item><title>在一张 1,000 美元的社会保障支票上，医疗保险 2027 年的保费上涨吞噬了 COLA 涨幅的 18%，并且对小额支票的打击最为严重</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/social-security-cola-2027-medicare-part-b-premium/</link><description>1 月份，标准 B 部分保费上涨至 209.40 美元，约占退休人员平均可乐保费的 9%，每月领取 1,000 美元的人则占 18%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2268639553.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/social-security-cola-2027-medicare-part-b-premium/</guid></item></channel></rss>